WEBVTT

00:09:58.093 --> 00:10:01.930
and his strategy and stance
on environmental issues.

00:10:01.972 --> 00:10:05.225
And he looked at me utterly baffled.

00:10:06.393 --> 00:10:08.896
It was nowhere on the agenda.

00:10:09.688 --> 00:10:13.025
Now, that looks increasingly
inconceivable, actually,

00:10:13.067 --> 00:10:14.693
but it certainly still happens.

00:10:15.444 --> 00:10:17.363
And then you get suppression.

00:10:18.238 --> 00:10:22.826
Or, "Let's just expel those voices
before it spreads."

00:10:24.036 --> 00:10:30.167
Now this is where leaders
explicitly silence or implicitly,